Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:40:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 01/31] Finder: rebrand Dolphin as a separate app

Own name, executable (finder), settings (finderrc), XMLGUI component,
D-Bus names and desktop file id, so it runs beside the system Dolphin.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KdkdNUmoM62iDwjRop6X5f
